1
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:06,479
This is Tidepool,
a notes app that

2
00:00:06,531 --> 00:00:08,510
keeps everything
on your own device.

3
00:00:08,951 --> 00:00:11,071
Let's capture a note
from start to finish.

4
00:00:12,245 --> 00:00:13,605
To start a note, press N.

5
00:00:14,005 --> 00:00:16,025
The New note button
does the same thing.

6
00:00:17,291 --> 00:00:18,511
The cursor is already in

7
00:00:18,511 --> 00:00:20,077
the title, so just type.

8
00:00:22,357 --> 00:00:24,607
Press Enter to jump
down to the body.

9
00:00:25,663 --> 00:00:26,973
The body is Markdown.

10
00:00:27,363 --> 00:00:28,618
A dash and two brackets

11
00:00:28,661 --> 00:00:29,806
make a checklist item.

12
00:00:31,276 --> 00:00:31,966
Press Enter,

13
00:00:32,136 --> 00:00:33,958
and the list carries
on by itself.

14
00:00:37,428 --> 00:00:39,144
In split view,
the preview on the

15
00:00:39,196 --> 00:00:40,814
right renders it as you type.

16
00:00:41,894 --> 00:00:43,874
Command E flips to
the full preview.

17
00:00:44,274 --> 00:00:45,844
Press it again to keep writing.

18
00:00:47,525 --> 00:00:48,755
Tags go under the title.

19
00:00:49,155 --> 00:00:51,023
Click Add tag, type planning,

20
00:00:51,229 --> 00:00:52,075
and press Enter.

21
00:00:53,715 --> 00:00:54,885
Then choose a notebook.

22
00:00:55,255 --> 00:00:56,675
This one belongs in Work.

23
00:00:58,255 --> 00:00:59,545
There's no save button.

24
00:00:59,945 --> 00:01:01,495
Tidepool saves as you type,

25
00:01:01,635 --> 00:01:03,230
and nothing leaves this device.

26
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:05,970
The sidebar says so too:

27
00:01:06,342 --> 00:01:07,917
sync is set to local only.

28
00:01:09,287 --> 00:01:10,957
Press Escape to
leave the editor,

29
00:01:11,217 --> 00:01:13,037
then P to pin the
note to the top.

30
00:01:15,217 --> 00:01:17,237
Pinned notes stay
above everything else,

31
00:01:17,407 --> 00:01:18,775
marked with a small pin.

32
00:01:20,565 --> 00:01:21,685
That's the whole loop.

33
00:01:21,905 --> 00:01:24,301
Press N, type, and
Tidepool keeps it.

34
00:01:26,071 --> 00:01:28,571
Next time: finding
any note in a second.
